Phase 1: GitHub Archive Ingestion Deployment

	[ ] Step 0: Enable Required APIs
		cloudbuild.googleapis.com
		run.googleapis.com
		cloudscheduler.googleapis.com
		iam.googleapis.com
		artifactregistry.googleapis.com
		cloudresourcemanager.googleapis.com

	[ ] Step 1: Create Artifact Registry repository
		gcloud artifacts repositories create github-archive --repository-format=docker --location=us-central1

	[ ] Step 2: Build container image
		gcloud builds submit --tag us-central1-docker.pkg.dev/dev-dataprocessing-489305/github-archive/github-archive-downloader:latest src/github_archive/

	[ ] Step 3: Initialize Terraform
		cd terraform && terraform init

	[ ] Step 4: Create Terraform workspace
		terraform workspace new dev

	[ ] Step 5: Review Terraform plan
		terraform plan -var="environment=dev" -var="project_id=dev-dataprocessing-489305" -var="region=us-central1"

	[ ] Step 6: Apply Terraform
		terraform apply -var="environment=dev" -var="project_id=dev-dataprocessing-489305" -var="region=us-central1"

	[ ] Step 7: Verify Cloud Run Job
		gcloud run jobs describe dev-github-archive-download-gsutil --region=us-central1

	[ ] Step 8: Verify Cloud Scheduler
		gcloud scheduler jobs describe dev-github-archive-download-job --region=us-central1

	[ ] Step 9: Test manual execution
		gcloud run jobs execute dev-github-archive-download-gsutil --region=us-central1

	[ ] Step 10: Verify files in GCS
		gsutil ls gs://dev-dataprocessing-489305-dev-github-archive-landing/github-archive/raw/

Post-Deployment
	[ ] Monitor first scheduled run
	[ ] Review Cloud Logs for errors
	[ ] Document any issues
